    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Egans are delighted to present this partially completed two-storey residential dwelling to the open market.\n\nThe property has been fitted with first-fix electrical wiring and now requires second-fix works and final completion, offering purchasers an excellent opportunity to finish the home to their own taste and specification.\n\nExtending to approximately 258 sq. m., the property is accessed via electric security gates framed by attractive cut-stone piers.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, living room, sitting room, kitchen/dining area, utility room, and guest WC on the ground floor. The first floor features four generously sized bedrooms, including two with en-suite bathrooms, together with a spacious family bathroom.\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in an advanced stage of construction.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with Egans."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
